---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="en" title="Privacy Policy — nramosdev" description="nramos.dev privacy policy under GDPR (EU).">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-16">
    <h1 class="font-mono text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Last updated: August 9, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none">
      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Nicolás Ramos</strong> — nramos.dev<br />
        Santa Cruz de Tenerife, Canary Islands, Spain (EU)<br />
        Contact: <a href="mailto:hola@nicolasramos.es">hola@nicolasramos.es</a>
      </p>
      <p>This website is hosted in a data center <strong>within the European Union</strong>, in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR 2016/679).</p>

      <h2>2. Data we process</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Browsing data:</strong> IP address, browser type, pages visited (anonymous statistics).</li>
        <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> only if you email hola@nicolasramos.es.</li>
        <li><strong>No</strong> personal data is collected through forms — this site has none.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Purpose and legal basis</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Display blog content and measure audience anonymously (legitimate interest, Art. 6.1.f GDPR).</li>
        <li>Reply to email inquiries (consent, Art. 6.1.a GDPR).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Retention</h2>
      <p>Contact data is kept only as long as needed to handle the inquiry. Anonymous statistics are kept while the analytics tool is active.</p>

      <h2>5. Recipients and transfers</h2>
      <p>No data is shared with third parties, except where legally required. No international transfers outside the EEA. Hosting and analytics services are located in the EU or in jurisdictions with adequate safeguards.</p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may exercise your rights of <strong>access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and portability</strong> by writing to <a href="mailto:hola@nicolasramos.es">hola@nicolasramos.es</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (aepd.es).</p>

      <h2>7. Security</h2>
      <p>The site is served over HTTPS with appropriate technical and organizational measures.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
